H('53.d.1.A',2,"A student in floral design wants to explore jobs. Which choice names real career paths?","Floral designer, florist shop owner, or event decorator",["Plumber only","Court reporter only","Airline pilot only"],"Floral design leads to jobs in shops, events and wholesale, including owning a business.")
H('53.d.1.A',3,"Which step best helps a floral design student plan an entrepreneurship path?","Researching what it costs to open a flower shop",["Waiting for a shop to appear","Avoiding all business classes","Choosing a name only"],"Start-up costs, supply sources and customers are key facts for planning.")
